Prefix: xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
Prefix: : <http://example.org/o>



Ontology: <http://example.org/o>


Datatype: rdf:PlainLiteral

    
Datatype: xsd:string

    
DataProperty: <http://example.org/o#d>

    
Class: <http://example.org/o#A>

    
Class: <http://example.org/o#B>

    
Individual: <http://example.org/o#i>

    
Individual: <http://example.org/o#j>

    
Rule: 
    <http://example.org/o#A>(?<http://example.org/o#x>), <http://example.org/o#d>(<http://example.org/o#i>, ?<http://example.org/o#y>) -> <http://example.org/o#B>(?<http://example.org/o#x>)

Rule: 
    <http://example.org/o#d>(<http://example.org/o#i>, "v"), <http://example.org/o#d>(?<http://example.org/o#x>, "w") -> <http://example.org/o#d>(<http://example.org/o#j>, ?<http://example.org/o#x>)

